 "design": "Blocked leave-one-year-out CV with a 12-month gap on each side (test year Y; train on target months outside [Y-1, Y+1]); pooled LightGBM across tier-1 grids (23 countries + Sichuan); one classifier and three quantile regressors per horizon; isotonic calibration cross-fitted on out-of-fold predictions; features respect publication lags (Ember t-2, GRACE t-3, GPCP rain and POWER soil/temperature t-1, ONI t-1); grid-history features (shortfall rate, anomaly spread) use only labels observed by t-2. Plus a strictly forward test (train on targets <= 2023-11, test targets 2024-01 onward).",
